From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Maxim Stepanov <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 4 Jul 2026 21:37:19 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] database_client: wire filter bar re-query, cell-selection
 value viewer, and toolbar toggle

Adds a WHERE filter bar to the results grid (Apply/Clear + inline error),
a QueryIntent::Filter re-query path in QueryView that wraps the base SQL
in sql_paging::filter_subquery while preserving sort and reverting on a
failed expression, and wires ResultsGridEvent::CellSelected into an
embedded ValueViewer shown via a new toolbar toggle. Also adds a
#[cfg(test)] value_for_test accessor on ValueViewer so the cell-selection
wiring test can assert on it from query_view.
---
